{
  "uid": "ops-agent-main",
  "title": "Ops Agent · 主链路大盘",
  "tags": [
    "ops-agent",
    "rag",
    "availability"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "⓪ 盘空先看这里：窗口内到底有没有流量",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "近 5 分钟请求数",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(chat_requests_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "请求数",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "无流量"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "description": "0 = 最近 5 分钟没有请求，下面所有 rate/分位数面板本来就该是空的。先发一条请求再判断「大盘坏了」。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "近 1 小时请求数",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 5,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(chat_requests_total[1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "请求数",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "无流量"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "description": "用来区分「刚空闲」和「一直没起来」：1 小时有数但 5 分钟没数 = 只是空闲。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "请求活动时间线",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 10,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 14,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(chat_requests_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "近 5 分钟请求数"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "无流量"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {},
      "description": "每条 = 该时刻最近 5 分钟的请求数。柱子出现在什么时候，就把时间窗拉到那一段，而不是怀疑面板。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "① 请求与延迟（TTFT / 分阶段）",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "请求成功率",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(chat_requests_total{result=\"ok\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(chat_requests_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "成功率",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "无流量"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "description": "口径：LLM 调用成功数 / 全部调用数。这不是 SLA —— 真实可用性看故障注入实验（scripts/fault_inject.py）。分母为 0 时这里显示「无流量」而不是 0%：0/0 是 NaN，曾经用 clamp_min(…,1e-9) 兜底，结果空闲时面板写着「0% 成功率」——一个会让所有人误判 AI 挂了的数字。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "吞吐（LLM 调用/秒）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(llm_requests_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "noValue": "无流量（窗口内没有请求）"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {},
      "description": "按 model 分。压测时它和 Locust 的 RPS 对照，能看出排队发生在哪一侧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "TTFT p50 / p95",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, cache) (rate(ttft_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p50 cache={{cache}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, cache) (rate(ttft_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "p95 cache={{cache}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "无流量（窗口内没有请求）"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {},
      "description": "只看首 token。缓存命中的请求会天然更快，所以按 cache 标签分开画 —— 混在一起会把缓存收益误读成模型变快。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "分阶段 P95（定位劣化出在哪一段）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, stage) (rate(stage_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{stage}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "无流量（窗口内没有请求）"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {},
      "description": "按阶段拆开。看「是哪一段变慢」比看总耗时有用得多 —— 总耗时劣化时，这里通常只有一段在涨。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "② 缓存（命中率与护栏）",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "缓存命中率（按层）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (layer) (rate(cache_requests_total{result=\"hit\"}[5m])) / sum by (layer) (rate(cache_requests_total{result=~\"hit|miss\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{layer}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "无缓存查询"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {},
      "description": "hit / (hit+miss)。rejected 是护栏拒绝，不是 miss —— 把它算进 miss 会让阈值调优的效果看不出来。分母为 0 时显示「无流量（无缓存查询）」，不是 0% 命中率。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "语义缓存候选相似度分布",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(cache_semantic_similarity_bucket[5m])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.9, sum by (le) (rate(cache_semantic_similarity_bucket[5m])))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "p90"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "无流量（窗口内没有请求）"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {},
      "description": "用来标定阈值：如果 p50 贴着阈值，说明阈值在误命中边缘。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "护栏拒绝（按原因）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(cache_guard_rejected_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "无流量（窗口内没有请求）"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {},
      "description": "护栏拒绝 = 向量很像但实体对不上（工单号/错误码不同）。它涨说明阈值在诱捕，不是缓存变差了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "缓存省下的 token（近 1 小时）",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
